01:34:22,347 --> 01:34:24,624
Are you bleeding?
You must get that looked at.

1348
01:34:24,869 --> 01:34:25,869
Hey, boykie?

1349
01:34:39,545 --> 01:34:41,056
You wanna heal that little girl?

1350
01:34:41,439 --> 01:34:43,269
You just need to come through me.

1351
01:34:57,880 --> 01:34:59,955
You got some fire in you, boykie.

1352
01:35:19,115 --> 01:35:20,356
You almost had me.

1353
01:35:20,982 --> 01:35:22,759
We die together, boykie.

1354
01:35:35,220 --> 01:35:36,220
Ok.

1355
01:35:36,515 --> 01:35:37,515
Ok.

1356
01:35:37,728 --> 01:35:38,783
Come on, man, let's go.

1357
01:35:47,311 --> 01:35:48,432
Let's go, man, let's do it.

1358
01:35:48,929 --> 01:35:49,929
Come on!

1359
01:35:57,682 --> 01:35:59,339
Ok. Let's go.

1360
01:36:03,888 --> 01:36:05,278
Get the door, now!

1361
01:36:12,145 --> 01:36:13,145
Come on.

1362
01:36:13,718 --> 01:36:14,718
Alright.

1363
01:36:15,508 --> 01:36:16,508
Let's do it.

1364
01:36:35,877 --> 01:36:36,904
Hurry.

1365
01:36:42,250 --> 01:36:43,828
Ok, we're good, we're good.

1366
01:36:44,215 --> 01:36:45,215
We're good.

1367
01:36:46,043 --> 01:36:47,043
What?

1368
01:36:50,981 --> 01:36:51,981
Max.

1369
01:36:52,327 --> 01:36:53,760
It's ok. I know.

1370
01:36:55,595 --> 01:36:57,376
There's no coming back from this.

1371
01:36:58,426 --> 01:36:59,887
No med-bay can heal you.

1372
01:37:14,276 --> 01:37:15,608
Alright, give it to me.

1373
01:37:18,662 --> 01:37:19,662
Take it.

1374
01:37:21,947 --> 01:37:22,947
Ok.

1375
01:37:23,181 --> 01:37:24,365
You just have to press...

1376
01:37:24,734 --> 01:37:25,734
that button.

1377
01:37:29,684 --> 01:37:30,684
Frey?

1378
01:37:32,791 --> 01:37:33,791
Max?

1379
01:37:33,918 --> 01:37:35,045
Max where are you?

1380
01:37:35,735 --> 01:37:37,524
I'm gonna have to break my promise.

1381
01:37:37,888 --> 01:37:39,732
I can't make it back up there.

1382
01:37:41,967 --> 01:37:44,208
You remember what I said
when we were kids?

1383
01:37:44,263 --> 01:37:45,263
Yes.

1384
01:37:46,166 --> 01:37:48,701
I'll take us there one day.
Really?

1385
01:37:48,992 --> 01:37:50,515
Yeah, I promise.

1386
01:38:00,832 --> 01:38:03,174
You would not believe
what I'm looking at right now.

1387
01:38:10,766 --> 01:38:13,001
Tell Matilda I really liked her story.

1388
01:38:13,752 --> 01:38:14,752
And..

1389
01:38:17,979 --> 01:38:19,805
I figured out why the Hippo did it.

1390
01:38:47,692 --> 01:38:48,692
Come on!

1391
01:38:49,717 --> 01:38:51,811
You go first. Come on!

1392
01:38:52,727 --> 01:38:55,527
Everyone have something special, Max.
Todos tenemos algo especial, Max.

1393
01:38:56,352 --> 01:38:59,309
Something we're already destined to do.
Algo que ya estamos destinados a hacer.

1394
01:38:59,333 --> 01:39:01,773
Something for which we were born
Algo para lo que ya nacemos..

1395
01:39:06,604 --> 01:39:08,154
Neutralize him.

1396
01:39:08,234 --> 01:39:09,492
Fuck you!

1397
01:39:16,947 --> 01:39:18,708
Let go of me!

1398
01:39:32,709 --> 01:39:34,758
Come on, please.

1399
01:39:57,831 --> 01:40:00,019
Hey, little girl, my love.
Hey, chiquita. Mi amor.

1400
01:40:05,440 --> 01:40:06,460
Hey.

1401
01:40:11,235 --> 01:40:12,794
Stand down, Officers.

1402
01:40:19,851 --> 01:40:20,851
Arrest him.

1403
01:40:21,419 --> 01:40:23,935
I can not arrest a citizen of Elysium.

1404
01:40:25,551 --> 01:40:26,551
What?

1405
01:40:26,759 --> 01:40:28,328
You did a great job.

1406
01:40:29,935 --> 01:40:31,759
Guess who Elysium belongs to now?

1407
01:41:27,765 --> 01:41:31,085
Do you see how beautiful it is from here?
¿Ves lo hermoso que nos parece desde aquí?

1408
01:41:31,131 --> 01:41:34,414
Now see how beautiful we look from there.
Ahora ve lo hermosos que nos vemos desde allí.

1409
01:41:34,438 --> 01:41:36,078
Now it belongs to you.
Ahora te pertenece.

1410
01:41:37,075 --> 01:41:39,065
So you never forget,
Para que no olvides nunca,

1411
01:41:39,089 --> 01:41:40,529
where you come from.
De dónde vienes.

1412
01:41:53,104 --> 01:41:54,364
My little Max.
Mi pequeño Max.

1413
01:42:00,994 --> 01:42:03,994
By LESAIGNEUR
Sync & corrections July 2020

